佳的能见度。","Waning Crescent":"残月","Last Quarter":"下弦月","ESE":"欧洲经济环境局","Waxing Gibbous":"盈凸月","Full Moon":"满月","E":"乙","WSW":"西西南","NE":"东北","Center on location":"居中显示位置","Data sources":"数据来源","Forecast time":"预报时间","Loading wind forecast…":"正在载入风力预报…","Map layers":"地图图层","Now":"现在","Open wind map":"打开风力地图","Pause":"暂停","Play":"播放","Retry":"重试","The arrows move in the direction the wind travels. The direction label shows where the wind comes from.":"线条沿风的流动方向移动。风向标签表示风从哪个方向吹来。","Wind Map":"风力地图","Wind Speed":"风速","Wind between forecast locations is estimated. Local conditions can differ, especially near mountains and coasts.":"预报地点之间的风况为估算值。当地实际情况可能不同，尤其是在山地和海岸附近。","Wind data unavailable":"风力数据不可用","Your Locations":"你的地点","Map Data":"地图数据","Weather data provided by Apple has been modified to create forecast maps.":"已对Apple提供的天气数据进行处理，以创建预报地图。","cardinal.N":"氮","cardinal.NNE":"北北东","cardinal.NE":"东北","cardinal.ENE":"埃尼","cardinal.E":"乙","cardinal.ESE":"欧洲经济环境局","cardinal.SE":"东南欧","cardinal.SSE":"上证所","cardinal.S":"S","cardinal.SSW":"SSW","cardinal.SW":"SW","cardinal.WSW":"西西南","cardinal.W":"瓦","cardinal.WNW":"西西北","cardinal.NW":"西北","cardinal.NNW":"西北西北","Temperature":"温度","%@'s chance: %d%%":"%@的机会：%d%%","About Feels Like Temperature":"关于体感温度","About Wind Speed and Gusts":"关于风速和阵风","About the Beaufort Scale":"关于蒲福氏量表","The dew point is what the temperature would need to fall to for dew to form. It can be a useful way to tell how humid the air feels — the higher the dew point, the more humid it feels. A dew point that matches the current temperature means the relative humidity is 100%, and there may be dew or fog.":"露点是温度需要降到什么程度才能形成露水。这是一种了解空气湿度的有用方法——露点越高，感觉越潮湿。露点与当前温度相匹配，表示相对湿度为100%，可能有露水或雾气。","About Dew Point":"关于露点","Relative humidity, commonly known just as humidity, is the amount of moisture in the air compared with what the air can hold. The air can hold more moisture at higher temperatures. A relative humidity near 100% means there may be dew or fog.":"相对湿度，通常称为湿度，是指空气中的水分含量与空气所能容纳的水分含量之比。空气在较高温度下可以容纳更多水分。相对湿度接近 100% 意味着可能有露水或雾气。","About Relative Humidity":"关于相对湿度","Intensity is calculated based on how much rain or snow falls per hour and is meant to indicate how heavy the rain or snow will feel. It is also used with other precipitation types such as sleet and wintry mix. A downpour or heavy snowstorm can have a \"heavy\" intensity, while an average rainfall or lighter drizzle can have a \"moderate\" or \"light\" intensity.":"强度根据每小时的降雨量或降雪量计算，用于表示雨雪的猛烈程度。它也适用于雨夹雪和冬季混合降水等其他降水类型。暴雨或强烈暴雪的强度可能为“强”，而普通降雨或较小的毛毛雨的强度可能为“中等”或“弱”。","About Precipitation Intensity":"关于降水强度","Significant, rapid changes in pressure are used to predict changes in the weather. For example, a drop in pressure can mean that rain or snow is on the way, and rising pressure can mean that weather will improve. Pressure is also called barometric pressure or atmospheric pressure.":"显着、快速的压力变化可用于预测天气变化。例如，气压下降可能意味着雨或雪即将来临，而气压上升可能意味着天气将会好转。压力也称为大气压或大气压。","About Pressure":"关于压力","Visibility tells you how far away you can clearly see objects like buildings and hills. It is a measure of the transparency of the air and does not take into account the amount of sunlight or the presence of obstructions. Visibility at or above %@ is considered clear.":"能见度告诉您可以清楚地看到建筑物和山丘等物体的距离有多远。它是空气透明度的衡量标准，不考虑阳光的量或障碍物的存在。能见度等于或高于 %@ 时被视为晴朗。","About Visibility":"关于可见性","Actual":"实际","Calm":"冷静","Light air":"轻空气","Storm":"风暴","Violent storm":"猛烈风暴","Hurricane-force":"飓风力","Light breeze":"微风","Gentle breeze":"微风徐徐","Moderate breeze":"微风","Fresh breeze":"清新的微风","Strong breeze":"强风","High wind":"大风","Gale":"大风","Strong gale":"强风","Description":"描述","Beaufort Scale":"蒲福氏量级","Chance of Precipitation":"降水机会","Clear":"晴朗无云","Foggy":"有雾","Hazy":"朦胧","Conditions":"条件","%d° now with %@ conditions. There is a precipitation chance of %@. Wind from %@ with gusts up to %d %@. Today's temperature ranges from %d° to %d° and feels like %d°. %@, and %@.":"%d° 现在具有 %@ 条件。有%@降水的机会。风速为%@，阵风可达%d%@。今天的气温范围是%d°到%d°，感觉像是%d°。 %@和%@。","Daily Summary":"每日总结","The daily chance of precipitation tends to be higher than the chance for each hour.":"每日降水的机会往往高于每小时降水的机会。","The dew point is %d° to %d°.":"露点为%d°至%d°。","The dew point will be %d° to %d°.":"露点将为 %d° 至 %d°。","Feels Like conveys how warm or cold it feels and can be different from the actual temperature. The Feels Like temperature is affected by humidity, sunlight and wind.":"体感温度表示实际感觉有多热或多冷，可能与实际气温不同。它会受到湿度、阳光和风的影响。","On %@, the average humidity will be %d%%.\n%@":"在%@，平均湿度为%d%%。\n%@","Today, the average humidity is %d%%. %@":"今天，平均湿度为%d%%。 %@","On %@, the total precipitation will be %.1f%@.":"%@，总降水量为%.1f%@。","On %@, the lowest visibility will be %@ at %d %@, and the highest will be %@ at %d %@.":"%@，最低能见度为%@，%d%@，最高能见度为%@，%d%@。","Today, the visibility will be %@, at %d to %d %@.":"今天，能见度为%@，%d至%d%@。","H: %d°":"最高：%d°","Humidity around %d%%":"湿度%d%%左右","Humidity Avg %d%%":"平均湿度 %d%%","Humidity %d%%":"湿度%d%%","Today's min %d%% – max %d%%":"今天的最小值%d%% – 最大值%d%%","LAST 24 HOURS":"过去 24 小时","L: %d°":"最低：%d°","NEXT 24 HOURS":"未来 24 小时","No hourly data available for this day.":"这一天没有可用的每小时数据。","%@'s low is %d° and the high is %d°. The temperature will feel like %d° to %d°. Wind from %@ is expected. %@":"%@ 的最低值是%d°，最高值是%d°。感觉温度为 %d° 至 %d°。预计%@有风。 %@","Hourly bars for rain & snow (%@).":"每小时雨雪时段 (%@)。","Heavy":"重型","Precipitation: 0%@":"降水量：0%@","Rain: %.1f%@":"雨：%.1f%@","Rain: %.1f%@, Snow: %.1f%@":"雨：%.1f%@，雪：%.1f%@","Precipitation Totals":"总降水量","On %@, the average pressure will be %@ %@, and the lowest pressure will be %@ %@.":"在%@，平均压力为%@%@，最低压力为%@%@。","Pressure Average %@ %@":"平均压力 %@ %@","Pressure %@ %@":"压力 %@ %@","Daily range: %@–%@ %@":"每日范围：%@–%@ %@","Rain":"下雨","Snow":"下雪","The Beaufort wind scale expresses how forceful or strong the wind is at a given speed. The Beaufort scale may make it easier to understand how windy it will feel or how much effect the wind could have. Each value on the scale corresponds to a 